n_to=https%3A%2F%2Fblizzardfan.itch.io%2Fgive-me-your-hand&amp;intent=community\" data-register_action=\"community_vote\" class=\"vote_down_btn vote_btn\"><svg height=\"20\" width=\"20\" aria-hidden viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" version=\"1.1\" class=\"svgicon icon_vote_down\" role=\"img\"><polygon points=\"2 6 12 18 22 6\" /></svg></a></div><a class=\"avatar_container\" href=\"https://itch.io/profile/brav3-studio\"><div style=\"background-image: url(https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzMwNTA5ODg0LmpwZw==/25x25%23/oc2V0k.jpg)\" class=\"post_avatar\"></div></a><div class=\"post_header\"><span class=\"post_author\"><a href=\"https://itch.io/profile/brav3-studio\">brav3</a></span><span title=\"2026-10-06 09:51:56\" class=\"post_date\"><a href=\"https://itch.io/post/17530241\">8 hours ago</a></span><span class=\"vote_counts\"></span></div><div class=\"post_content\"><div dir=\"auto\" class=\"post_body user_formatted\"><p></p><p>You’ve executed this beautifully. I really liked the style and gameplay. It’s great that you tied the progression to the tiers and money earned rather than using an Balatro&#x27;s classic&nbsp;ante system. Perhaps I would have liked the game&#x27;s escalating difficulty to make the wrong decisions we make feel more impactful. &lt;3</p></div><div class=\"post_footer\"><a href=\"https://itch.io/login?return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fblizzardfan.itch.io%2Fgive-me-your-hand&amp;intent=community\" class=\"post_action reply_btn\" data-register_action=\"community_reply\">Reply</a></div></div></div></div><div data-post=\"{&quot;id&quot;:17530001,&quot;user_id&quot;:12908372}\" id=\"post-17530001\" class=\"community_post has_vote_column\"><div class=\"post_grid\"><div class=\"post_votes\"><a title=\"Vote up\" href=\"https://itch.io/login?return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fblizzardfan.itch.io%2Fgive-me-your-hand&amp;intent=community\" data-register_action=\"community_vote\" class=\"vote_up_btn vote_btn\"><svg height=\"20\" width=\"20\" aria-hidden viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" version=\"1.1\" class=\"svgicon icon_vote_up\" role=\"img\"><polygon points=\"2 18 12 6 22 18\" /></svg></a> <a title=\"Vote down\" href=\"https://itch.io/login?return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fblizzardfan.itch.io%2Fgive-me-your-hand&amp;intent=community\" data-register_action=\"community_vote\" class=\"vote_down_btn vote_btn\"><svg height=\"20\" width=\"20\" aria-hidden viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" version=\"1.1\" class=\"svgicon icon_vote_down\" role=\"img\"><polygon points=\"2 6 12 18 22 6\" /></svg></a></div><a class=\"avatar_container\" href=\"https://itch.io/profile/1azyf0x\"><div style=\"background-image: url(/static/images/frog-red.png)\" class=\"post_avatar\"></div></a><div class=\"post_header\"><span class=\"post_author\"><a href=\"https://itch.io/profile/1azyf0x\">1azyf0x</a></span><span title=\"2026-10-06 08:59:14\" class=\"post_date\"><a href=\"https://itch.io/post/17530001\">9 hours ago</a></span><span class=\"vote_counts\"></span></div><div class=\"post_content\"><div dir=\"auto\" class=\"post_body user_formatted\"><p>Got the royal flush. Good game.</p></div><div class=\"post_footer\"><a href=\"https://itch.io/login?return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fblizzardfan.itch.io%2Fgive-me-your-hand&amp;intent=community\" class=\"post_action reply_btn\" data-register_action=\"community_reply\">Reply</a></div></div></div></div><div data-post=\"{&quot;id&quot;:17201110,&quot;user_id&quot;:19003112}\" id=\"post-17201110\" class=\"community_post has_vote_column\"><div id=\"last-post\" class=\"post_anchor\"></div><div class=\"post_grid\"><div class=\"post_votes\"><a title=\"Vote up\" href=\"https://itch.io/login?return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fblizzardfan.itch.io%2Fgive-me-your-hand&amp;intent=community\" data-register_action=\"community_vote\" class=\"vote_up_btn vote_btn\"><svg height=\"20\" width=\"20\" aria-hidden viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" version=\"1.1\" class=\"svgicon icon_vote_up\" role=\"img\"><polygon points=\"2 18 12 6 22 18\" /></svg></a> <a title=\"Vote down\" href=\"https://itch.io/login?return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fblizzardfan.itch.io%2Fgive-me-your-hand&amp;intent=community\" data-register_action=\"community_vote\" class=\"vote_down_btn vote_btn\"><svg height=\"20\" width=\"20\" aria-hidden viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" version=\"1.1\" class=\"svgicon icon_vote_down\" role=\"img\"><polygon points=\"2 6 12 18 22 6\" /></svg></a></div><a class=\"avatar_container\" href=\"https://itch.io/profile/eyeballmerchant\"><div style=\"background-image: url(https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI5NjMwMzAxLmpwZw==/25x25%23/QN5LRM.jpg)\" class=\"post_avatar\"></div></a><div class=\"post_header\"><span class=\"post_author\"><a href=\"https://itch.io/profile/eyeballmerchant\">eyeballmerchant</a></span><span title=\"2026-08-31 15:06:05\" class=\"post_date\"><a href=\"https://itch.io/post/17201110\">36 days ago</a></span><span class=\"vote_counts\"></span></div><div class=\"post_content\"><div dir=\"auto\" class=\"post_body user_formatted\"><p>Wow, I love the grim mood and ambience. The game is easy to understand and it is definitely something I would enjoy with a coffee in hand! There were definitely some difficulty spikes as you progress in the game. I think the hardest to decipher is definitely the one with the smallest fold. Although sometimes I found myself taking the cards from the liar because it fits my deck haha! Good job making the game!</p></div><div class=\"post_footer\"><a href=\"https://itch.io/login?return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fblizzardfan.itch.io%2Fgive-me-your-hand&amp;intent=community\" class=\"post_action reply_btn\" data-register_action=\"community_reply\">Reply</a></div></div></div></div><script id=\"vote_counts_tpl\" type=\"text/template\"><% if (up_score > 0) { %><span class=\"upvotes\">(+{{up_score}})</span><% } %><% if (down_score > 0) { %><span class=\"downvotes\">(-{{down_score}})</span><% } %></script></div></div></div></div><div class=\"right_col column\"><div class=\"video_embed\"></div><div class=\"screenshot_list\"><a data-image_lightbox=\"true\" href=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1hZ2UvNDk